{"id": null, "n": "0166001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0166001", "type": "orig", "text": "「竺」，底本作「竹」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0166002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0166002", "type": "orig", "text": "「正」，底本作「安」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167001", "type": "orig", "text": "「諸」，底本作「者」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本此字不清。田中良昭辨作「耶」，西口芳男辨作「恥」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167003", "type": "orig", "text": "「著」，底本作「看」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167004", "type": "orig", "text": "「云」，底本無，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167005", "type": "orig", "text": "引文出自《維摩經．佛國品》，見《大正藏》第14卷第537頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167006", "type": "orig", "text": "「云」，底本無，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167007", "type": "orig", "text": "「持」，底本作「物」，據北新1254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0167008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0167008", "type": "orig", "text": "引文出自《維摩經．佛國品》，見《大正藏》第14卷第537頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168001", "type": "orig", "text": "「念」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168002", "type": "orig", "text": "「心」，底本作「心心」，據北新1254號刪。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168003", "type": "orig", "text": "「爾」，底本作「示」，據北新1254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168004", "type": "orig", "text": "「形」，底本作「刑」，據北新1254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168005", "type": "orig", "text": "引文出自《維摩詰經．見阿閦佛品》，見《大正藏》第14卷第554頁下～第555頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0168006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0168006", "type": "orig", "text": "「自」，底本作「身」，據北新1254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169001", "type": "orig", "text": "「即是僧寶。動成物執，即為法義，即是法寶。常覺，即為佛義」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169002", "type": "orig", "text": "「久見佛」，底本作「覓道」，據北新254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169003", "type": "orig", "text": "「邪」，底本作「耶」，據文意改。下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169004", "type": "orig", "text": "引文出自《維摩詰經．見阿閦佛品》，見《大正藏》第14卷第555頁上。引文中「若自觀者」，《維摩詰經》原文作「以斯觀者」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169005", "type": "orig", "text": "「禪」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169006", "type": "orig", "text": "「心」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169007", "type": "orig", "text": "「覺」，底本作「覺之」，據文意刪。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169008", "type": "orig", "text": "「念佛」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169009", "type": "orig", "text": "「提」，底本作「提。謂覺煩惱性空，無有處所，名為菩提」，據北新1254號刪。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169010", "type": "orig", "text": "「慧」，底本作「惠」，此處「慧」、「惠」相通，故正作「慧」。下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169011", "type": "orig", "text": "引文出自《大正藏》第9卷第58頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169012", "type": "orig", "text": "「心」，底本無，據北新1254號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0170001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0170001", "type": "orig", "text": "「辨」，底本作「辯」，據北新1254號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0170002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0170002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本此處空白一行餘，似有文字脫漏未抄，或即為北新1254號之「乃是智者所知，非是凡情所惻（測）」句。"}
